{"originalLanguage":"en","title":"Unstoppable","artist":"Sia","date":"2026-08-18","sourceId":"14756908:011","sourceHash":"77d7349e794e5c811d29e516001c843204e6718933c0cb52d9d4cb91c7ae5047","duration":219.74,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":15.448,"end":19.097,"text":"All smiles, I know what it takes to fool this town","translation":"환하게 웃으며 이 도시를 속이는 법을 알아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":19.097,"end":21.827,"text":"I'll do it 'til the sun goes down","translation":"해가 질 때까지 그렇게 할 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":21.827,"end":24.857,"text":"And all through the nighttime","translation":"밤새도록","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":24.857,"end":26.536,"text":"Oh, yeah","translation":"오 예","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":26.536,"end":29.736,"text":"Oh, yeah, I'll tell you what you wanna hear","translation":"오 예 네가 듣고 싶은 말을 해 줄게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":29.736,"end":32.566,"text":"Leave my sunglasses on while I shed a tear","translation":"눈물을 흘리면서도 선글라스는 벗지 않아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":32.566,"end":36.125,"text":"It's never the right time","translation":"적절한 때는 절대 아니야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":36.125,"end":37.655,"text":"Yeah, yeah","translation":"예 예","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":37.655,"end":43.104,"text":"I put my armor on, show you how strong I am","translation":"갑옷을 입고 내가 얼마나 강한지 네게 보여 줄게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":43.104,"end":48.693,"text":"I put my armor on, I'll show you that I am","translation":"갑옷을 입고 내가 그렇다는 걸 네게 보여 줄게","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":48.693,"end":51.603,"text":"I'm unstoppable","translation":"난 멈출 수 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":51.603,"end":54.322,"text":"I'm a Porsche with no brakes","translation":"난 브레이크 없는 포르쉐야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":54.322,"end":56.922,"text":"I'm invincible","translation":"난 무적이야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":56.922,"end":59.892,"text":"Yeah, I win every single game","translation":"예 난 매 게임마다 이겨","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":59.892,"end":62.321,"text":"I'm so powerful","translation":"난 아주 강력해","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":62.321,"end":65.321,"text":"I don't need batteries to play","translation":"놀기 위해 배터리는 필요 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":65.321,"end":68.03,"text":"I'm so confident","translation":"난 아주 자신 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":68.03,"end":71.09,"text":"Yeah, I'm unstoppable today","translation":"예 오늘 난 멈출 수 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":71.09,"end":73.99,"text":"Unstoppable today","translation":"오늘 멈출 수 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":73.99,"end":76.829,"text":"Unstoppable today","translation":"오늘 멈출 수 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":76.829,"end":79.219,"text":"Unstoppable today","translation":"오늘 멈출 수 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":79.219,"end":81.568,"text":"I'm unstoppable today","translation":"오늘 난 멈출 수 없어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":81.568,"end":85.318,"text":"Break down, only alone I will cry out loud","translation":"무너져도 혼자 있을 때만 소리 내 울 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":85.318,"end":88.168,"text":"You'll never see what's hiding out","translation":"네겐 내가 숨기고 있는 게 절대 보이지 않을 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":88.168,"end":91.107,"text":"Hiding out deep down","translation":"마음 깊은 곳에 숨긴 채","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":91.107,"end":92.657,"text":"Yeah, yeah","translation":"예 예","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":92.657,"end":96.116,"text":"I know, I've heard that to let your feelings show","translation":"감정을 드러내야 한다고 들었어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":96.116,"end":98.986,"text":"Is the only way to make friendships grow","translation":"우정을 키우는 유일한 방법이라고","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":98.986,"end":102.215,"text":"But I'm too afraid now","translation":"하지만 지금은 너무 두려워","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":102.215,"end":103.805,"text":"Yeah, yeah","translation":"예 예","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":103.805,"end":109.264,"text":"I put my armor on, show you how strong I am","translation":"갑옷을 입고 내가 얼마나 강한지 네게 보여 줄게",